  "intro": {
   "zh": "MediaPipe Face Landmarker 官方说明：检测画面里的面部关键点和表情，输出三维面部关键点、融合变形系数和变换矩阵。这张卡交付 52 条 ARKit 表情曲线和跟着头动的面具网格。",
   "en": "From the MediaPipe Face Landmarker documentation: it detects face landmarks and expressions in images, outputting 3D face landmarks, blend shape scores and transformation matrices. This card delivers 52 ARKit expression curves and a face mesh that follows the head."
  },
